; With infer_tolerance_from_cost, a posting at cost widens the USD tolerance
; to 0.01548, so the amount-less posting is rounded to the step 0.03096 and
; keeps its five decimals (0.01088, rendered 0.010 at USD's display
; precision) instead of rounding to 0.011.
option "infer_tolerance_from_cost" "TRUE"

